    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "The Rainbow See Saw sets two blue seats on an arched beam shaped like a rainbow. The curved beam keeps the ride gentle and low, which suits the 3 to 6 years Key User Group. Two children ride at a time. It measures 6'4\" x 1'7\", the shortest of our see saws, with a safe play area of 10'4\" x 5'7\". That lets it fit along a narrow path or between two larger pieces. Its colour is Knight Blue. Parents of small children often look for a see saw with a modest height, and the rainbow arch gives exactly that. Our 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipes and roto-moulded parts. Tell us your site size and we will check the fit."
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "component": "ProductSpecifications2",
